This project turns a Raspberry Pi 3a+ into a multi functional audio device. It is running in a buildroot environment, which is part of the repo as well. 
-  Documentation is README.md and everything in /doc

### General rules for this task:

- Run only short, focused commands.
- Ensure each inspection command prints a heading or guaranteed result.
- Avoid compound diff/status commands that may be silent.
- Never ever use heredocs.
- Never use ‘git diff --stat’
- Never run interactive commands. Also avoid commands which result in paginated output.


